    <string name="agree_view" formatted="false">View details</string>
    <string name="privacy_full" formatted="false">※ Demo service · draft before legal review.\n\n1. What we collect: email, password (stored encrypted), name, gender, date of birth, mobile number, messenger and ID for contact, nationality, display language, medical records (clinic, treatment, prescription), photos of prescriptions or medicine bags, questions to the chatbot\n2. Why: to give medication and aftercare guides, answer chatbot questions, and send contact requests to a clinic you choose\n3. How long: until you delete your account (deleted right away). Chatbot conversations are deleted automatically after 30 days\n4. Sensitive (health) information: medical records, prescriptions and photos are sensitive health information. We use them only for the purposes above, and this consent also covers processing of sensitive information.\n5. Transfer abroad: recipient OpenAI (United States) · items: medical records, photos, chatbot questions (phone numbers, emails and ID numbers in questions are hidden first; text printed on photos may be sent as is) · purpose: AI guides, photo reading, chatbot answers · when and how: each time you use these features, over encrypted connections · retention: per OpenAI\'s policy\n6. Your right to refuse: you may refuse, but without consent you cannot sign up or use the service.\n\nDo not enter real patient information in demos.</string>
    <string name="terms_full" formatted="false">※ Demo service · draft before legal review.\n\n1. GlowPass is an information service for aftercare following dermatology treatments. It does not diagnose, prescribe or recommend specific medicines.\n2. AI guidance is for reference only. If symptoms are severe or it is an emergency, contact a clinic or call 119 right away.\n3. You choose clinics yourself from the list. GlowPass does not recommend clinics or take referral fees.\n4. Entering someone else\'s information or disrupting the service may lead to restricted use.\n5. You can delete your account and records at any time with \'Delete account\'.</string>
